@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Git transport and preview limits
actor "Git client or browser" as Client
component "Nginx request boundary\n100m body; 60s FastCGI defaults" as Nginx
component "Laravel Git transport\n104857600-byte request default" as API
component "Controlled Git process\n30-second default" as Git
component "Repository browser\nText: 1 MiB; PDF: 100 MiB defaults" as Browse
Client --> Nginx
Nginx --> API : Git RPCs; buffering disabled
API --> Git : authorized arguments and paths
Nginx --> Browse : permitted preview request
note bottom of Browse : Preview bounds are independent of Git push limits
note bottom of Git : Align limits across layers; defaults do not guarantee throughput
@enduml
